        "[DOC_ID:task-model] Task model routing  \nOpen WebUI routes titles, tags, follow-up suggestions, retrieval queries, web-search queries, and autocomplete through the configured task model. Administrators can set a local or smaller task model without changing the main chat model.",
        "[DOC_ID:task-cap] Task output limits  \nThe task.model.params dictionary applies generation parameters across task endpoints. A max_tokens cap therefore reaches titles and autocomplete as well as tags, follow-ups, and queries; it is not a narrow tag-only control."
